  "conclusions": [
    "Both GET and POST methods are fully functional",
    "Three main parameters: lang, recursive, includeTables",
    "Format support: JSON and XML only (CSV/JSONP not functional)",
    "subjects parameter returns 400 error (not supported)",
    "Response times are consistent and predictable (100-540ms)",
    "Full catalog is large (1.3MB) but manageable",
    "API uses lenient error handling (malformed JSON = empty body)",
    "No server-side caching (Cache-Control: no-cache)",
    "Subject taxonomy is stable (good candidate for client caching)",
    "Tables only appear at leaf nodes of the hierarchy"
  ]
